{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53816","headline":"句 二 · 白居易","name":"句 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧浪金波三五初，秋风计会似空虚。\n（同前书卷上《十五夜》）（〖1〗川口久雄校注云：「私注作『《月影满秋池诗》发句，菅淳茂』。\n《文粹》八作『《八月十五夜侍亭子院同赋月影满秋池应太上法皇制》，菅淳茂』。\n……底本注作者『白』，似误。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}